  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0117d399-8a7d-4092-be8b-2e3458f3de10",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Turtle Games's want an analysis of marketing data. It wants to better understand how users accumulate loyalty\n",
    "points and how this information can be used in the marketing department\n",
    "We need to investigate the possible relation between the loyalty points, age, remuneration, and spending scores.\n",
    "We have to comment on observed trends, interpret the observations, and propose marketing prioritise and decisions.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 388,
   "id": "4d0f2dd3-7b26-49ae-9051-2c8ab6d75f94",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
