   "source": [
    "The top 20 positive reviews and summaries have a score of 1.0 which tell us a strong positive texts. \n",
    "The sentiment of the top 20 negative reviews goes fomr -1.0 to -0.4  \n",
    "and the top 20 negative summaries  goes fomr -1.0 to -0.59 which indicate a more positive then negative sentiment overhall.\n",
    "\n",
    "The frequency toward a more positive sentiment than negative is confirm even trough the histogram polarity distribution graphs.\n",
    "The graphs deline a skewness toward positive rather than negative, indicating that more comments express satisfaction than disappointment."
   ]
