  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a3b39e53-e77b-41d9-a142-53e9fb29a76e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The sentiment analysis reveal a strongly more positive than negative sentiment. \n",
    "The key feature that the customers appreciate are quality, its suitable as a gift, and enjoyment. \n",
    "'Awesome' is  very recurrent word which shows a direct and positive appreciation of the product.\n",
    "There are less negative comments that express dissatisfactions, so the 'brand reputation' remains strong.\n",
    "The negative comments in both summary and reviews ('boring' and 'disappointing' are very frequent words) reveal some key area for improvements.  \n",
    "\n",
    "Future improvemnt could dive into specific non appreciate area as usability, or cluster negative comments and review for more insights. Would be interesitng to monitor the sentiment over time, it could reveal emerging concerns. I decide to add an analysis of 'Average Customer Satisfaction' both for summart and reviews data. "
   ]
  },
